      ],
      "prompt": "Same painted 3D game-art style and the same elven forest culture as these two figures: a tall walking tree guardian, a treant with a humanlike body of thick bark, two sturdy legs like roots and two long branch arms, a crown of chunky leaf clumps on its head, moss on the shoulders, pale glowing blue rune marks on the bark and royal blue cloth ribbons tied around its arms. Arms held well clear of the body."
    }
